That is correct.  "la fzzzzg." can be read as "le se cmene be zo fzzzzg bei mi"
and analogously for "doi fzzzzg.".  As a result, all uses of names in
Lojban can be paraphrased away so that only uninterpreted words within quotation
marks remain.

